- [38;5;10mprint_foo.rs[0m — all 64 bit-field combinations × 10 [38;5;10mz[0m values; padding bits 6–31 set to garbage patterns; [38;5;10mz[0m sweep over powers of two and neighbours; multi-call sequences.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mdriver.rs[0m — [38;5;10mx[0m,[38;5;10my[0m ∈ 0..16 exhaustive (past their 2- and 3-bit widths) × both booleans × 8 [38;5;10mz[0m values; [38;5;10mu32[0m extremes and all single-bit values; full [38;5;10mz[0m sweep.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mbool_abi.rs[0m — all 256 byte values for the [38;5;10mbool[0m parameter, which is what caught the bug.[0m[0m
